WEBVTT

00:17.120 --> 00:18.620
GHOST BUSTERZ!

00:17.500 --> 00:20.250
OH! The time has come

00:18.040 --> 00:18.620
BUSTERZ!

00:20.250 --> 00:23.630
To stand up for tomorrow

00:22.590 --> 00:24.050
OH OH OH!

00:23.630 --> 00:26.210
We're ghostbusterz

00:26.210 --> 00:30.840
Breakin' away from the old ghosts

00:30.840 --> 00:34.220
Of history

00:34.220 --> 00:37.600
Breaking free!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!

01:13.090 --> 01:16.890
No fear for anything in our way!

01:15.430 --> 01:20.230
Presented by Strelizia subs

01:16.890 --> 01:18.430
The time has come

01:32.820 --> 01:37.040
The seventh month of 1600 AD, or Keicho 5.

01:37.410 --> 01:41.210
Charging Tokugawa Ieyasu with thirteen articles of impeachment,

01:41.210 --> 01:48.130
Ishida Mitsunari sent messengers to various daimyo in the name of the Toyotomi clan,

01:48.130 --> 01:51.300
telling them to raise armies.

01:51.300 --> 01:56.390
At the same time, beings seeking to end the period of turbulence

01:56.390 --> 02:00.270
and build a kingdom to last a thousand years

02:00.270 --> 02:04.520
were about to awaken from a thousand-year sleep.

02:04.520 --> 02:06.520
And then...

02:06.520 --> 02:10.280
On the fifteenth day of the ninth month, at Sekigahara,

02:10.280 --> 02:12.740
the Eastern Army of Tokugawa Ieyasu clashed with

02:12.740 --> 02:17.870
the Western Army of the Toyotomi clan and Ishida Mitsunari.

02:17.870 --> 02:21.330
As a result of the performance of Kobayakawa Hideaki's troops,

02:21.330 --> 02:27.250
the Western Army of the Toyotomi clan and
Ishida Mitsunari achieved a sweeping victory,

02:27.250 --> 02:33.510
bringing what should have been
three hundred years of peace to the world.

02:34.340 --> 02:39.390
You should all be quite familiar with this story...

02:46.880 --> 02:49.100
You must have forgotten me by now.

02:49.120 --> 02:53.070
I'm Danjo, the samurai that
serves Princess Kaguya.

02:54.280 --> 03:00.430
The demon gun that Musashi got from
Takuan once belonged to Mitsuhide Akechi,

03:00.440 --> 03:07.030
who used it to kill
Nobunaga Oda at Honnoji.

03:07.200 --> 03:13.870
Mitsuhide's betrayal was an act
committed under the influence of the demon.

03:14.040 --> 03:17.160
I didn't know anything about that, really.

03:17.320 --> 03:19.440
I was out of my mind.

03:19.600 --> 03:26.200
On the other hand, we have the ayakashi
plot to capture Princess Kaguya.

03:28.240 --> 03:35.190
The worst part is that I didn't
even realize that was their plan.

03:35.360 --> 03:37.110
What do I do? What do I do?

03:37.360 --> 03:43.830
What would I do if something
happened to Princess Kaguya?

03:46.560 --> 03:49.870
The War-Torn
World Returns

04:14.520 --> 04:16.800
Princess Kaguya, wait for me!

04:17.760 --> 04:19.750
You're going too fast!

04:23.920 --> 04:25.480
Princess Kaguya!

04:26.760 --> 04:28.750
Danjo, you poor thing!

04:28.920 --> 04:33.440
What about your reputation as the
vanguard samurai of Sekigahara?

04:36.800 --> 04:38.470
Princess!

05:07.760 --> 05:09.510
I'm hungry as hell!

05:10.880 --> 05:17.560
Musashi, you said you wanted
to go East, but where exactly?

05:17.720 --> 05:21.840
Recently, I've been feeling
nervous and I didn't know why.

05:23.760 --> 05:28.990
I have reflected a lot on it and
now I understand the reason.

05:30.440 --> 05:36.320
So you want to go East to calm the nerves?

05:37.040 --> 05:38.080
Don't you?

05:40.760 --> 05:42.880
I guess it is worth going.

05:43.040 --> 05:44.190
Thank you.

05:44.760 --> 05:47.830
So, what's East?

05:48.000 --> 05:51.150
Something that will finally satisfy you?

05:52.200 --> 05:53.870
A castle!

05:55.320 --> 05:58.440
A super modern castle that has just been built!

05:59.880 --> 06:02.390
You want to conquer it?

06:02.760 --> 06:04.430
Of course!

06:04.600 --> 06:07.670
Our real business is robbing castles!

06:09.040 --> 06:11.550
We are not ayakashi hunters.

06:11.720 --> 06:13.200
So, who owns this castle?

06:14.000 --> 06:16.150
Date Masamune, the One-Eyed Dragon!

06:16.360 --> 06:17.710
The Aoba Castle?

06:22.280 --> 06:24.640
But Sendai is not around the corner.

06:25.520 --> 06:32.430
We'll make the trip, and during it, we can
search for information on the second gun.

06:33.120 --> 06:34.680
I understand.

06:34.840 --> 06:38.630
It's not a bad idea to take a
detour before going to Sendai.

06:39.240 --> 06:40.310
Right?

06:57.360 --> 06:58.560
Am I hearing things?

07:25.360 --> 07:27.110
My Lord!

07:34.880 --> 07:36.150
My Lord?

07:36.360 --> 07:37.920
My Lord, where are you?

07:47.600 --> 07:48.640
My Lord...

08:18.200 --> 08:19.520
Mitsunari!

08:19.680 --> 08:21.880
My Lord, that's dangerous!

08:22.040 --> 08:23.870
Come down, please!

08:24.720 --> 08:26.390
Mitsunari, the brush.

08:27.600 --> 08:29.350
Give me that brush back.

08:30.360 --> 08:31.790
The brush?

08:33.280 --> 08:36.480
It comes from the barbarians
of the South, I like it a lot.

08:39.320 --> 08:42.230
So? Not too bad, right?

08:42.800 --> 08:44.920
As expected of my Lord.

08:45.080 --> 08:49.710
Your late father Hideyoshi
was also good at painting.

08:51.160 --> 08:55.600
You mean to say he was better than me?

08:56.520 --> 08:58.430
Certainly not!

08:59.880 --> 09:05.120
Painting is a wonderful thing,
but don't forget politics...

09:05.800 --> 09:06.790
No, no!

09:06.960 --> 09:10.720
I trust you completely to handle that sort of thing.

09:11.760 --> 09:17.360
But you are the great general who
rules over the Land of the Rising Sun!

09:22.320 --> 09:29.120
I beg of you, in order to keep
the peace as your father wished...

09:29.840 --> 09:33.800
That's enough!
You ruined my good mood!

09:34.720 --> 09:36.520
I beg for your forgiveness.

09:41.040 --> 09:42.540
Where is my older sister?

09:43.400 --> 09:45.630
Princess Kaguya?

09:45.800 --> 09:49.560
I don't remember having any others!

09:50.160 --> 09:57.070
I am sorry to remind you that Princess Kaguya
is the adoptive daughter of Lord Hideyoshi.

09:57.240 --> 09:59.150
She does not have your blood.

10:00.040 --> 10:01.950
I know!

10:02.640 --> 10:07.840
That doesn't change the
fact that she matters to me!

10:11.000 --> 10:13.750
I asked you where my sister Kaguya is!

10:14.760 --> 10:17.720
I haven't finished her portrait!

11:05.720 --> 11:09.240
Yasha? Where do we stand?
What about Kaguya?

11:09.400 --> 11:10.600
Where is she?

11:11.480 --> 11:14.550
She left Osaka Castle.

11:15.160 --> 11:16.630
Where did she go?

11:17.200 --> 11:20.240
Looks like she went for
a ride to distract herself.

11:20.720 --> 11:22.150
To distract herself?

11:22.520 --> 11:24.080
She had to get some air.

11:24.880 --> 11:30.880
Her being on Toyotomi's side puts
my dreams of taking power in danger.

11:31.680 --> 11:37.670
I assure you your dreams of
taking power are not over.

11:39.480 --> 11:48.320
If we forget about the Moon Princess, your reign,
Lord Ieyasu, will undoubtedly take place.

11:48.480 --> 11:50.760
It would displease me greatly otherwise!

11:51.480 --> 11:53.200
What do we do about Kaguya?

11:54.080 --> 11:57.870
If it's full moon night, we can take action.

11:58.040 --> 12:05.120
But during the new moon, that's when
the ayakashi are most vulnerable.

12:05.320 --> 12:07.120
It's not the best time to act.

12:08.880 --> 12:11.440
But should we do nothing?

12:12.160 --> 12:17.960
In two weeks, the Toyotomi will
attempt to seal the ayakashi.

12:18.160 --> 12:21.550
We cannot let ourselves be caught off guard!

12:21.760 --> 12:23.190
Am I wrong?

12:23.360 --> 12:24.350
No.

13:01.160 --> 13:03.880
Princess Kaguya, run away!

13:05.000 --> 13:07.990
What does it look like I'm doing?

13:22.040 --> 13:23.080
What is it?

13:25.600 --> 13:28.400
My Meiretsu is trembling a bit.

13:29.040 --> 13:30.610
Did it sense an ayakashi?

13:31.000 --> 13:34.150
Perhaps, but it must be far away.

13:34.360 --> 13:41.510
Doesn't matter. If we fight every
ayakashi we find, we'll wear ourselves out.

13:41.680 --> 13:43.080
Exactly.

13:53.560 --> 13:56.000
Are you Musashi Miyamoto?

13:56.560 --> 13:58.010
Who are you?

14:01.640 --> 14:03.790
I am Hidetada Tokugawa.

14:04.920 --> 14:07.070
One of leyasu's sons?

14:07.240 --> 14:08.680
So you are him.

14:11.000 --> 14:14.070
I am sorry about your defeat in Sekigahara.

14:14.240 --> 14:19.630
If you had won, you father would be
shogun by now and you would be his heir.

14:20.560 --> 14:24.440
War hinges on luck, no reason to regret the past.

14:25.240 --> 14:26.830
So, what do you want from us?

14:31.680 --> 14:33.130
Princess Kaguya!

14:38.400 --> 14:39.990
You'll pay for that!

14:53.600 --> 14:55.880
I will not forget!

15:04.280 --> 15:05.510
This is delicious!

15:07.840 --> 15:10.560
I am glad you like it.

15:10.720 --> 15:14.710
The long journey from Sumpu was worth it.

15:15.240 --> 15:18.710
Sumpu? Weren't you in Edo?

15:19.720 --> 15:23.080
Edo is full of monsters,
men cannot live there.

15:24.480 --> 15:28.950
So it's true that Edo was invaded by ayakashi.

15:30.920 --> 15:33.560
So, what do you want from us?

15:36.480 --> 15:42.740
I apologize for stopping
you suddenly to ask this.

15:45.960 --> 15:49.180
I wish to ask for your help, Musashi Miyamoto.

15:53.720 --> 15:56.680
I ask you to kill my father, leyasu Tokugawa!

16:04.960 --> 16:07.110
Princess, run away!

16:16.600 --> 16:17.860
Curse you!

16:23.640 --> 16:26.280
Princess, quickly, run away.

16:41.160 --> 16:43.160
Princess... so strong.

16:50.160 --> 16:51.960
I'm being underestimated.

16:52.920 --> 16:58.510
The ayakashi attack me on a new moon day, when they are vulnerable.

16:59.120 --> 17:01.710
Do you understand, Princess?

17:01.880 --> 17:03.600
Let's get back, quickly.

17:03.760 --> 17:05.990
Let's get back quickly to Osaka Castle.

17:06.160 --> 17:08.880
Agreed, I was able to get some action.

17:09.600 --> 17:11.320
Princess...

17:22.320 --> 17:26.920
The ayakashi are indeed weak during new moon.

17:27.080 --> 17:31.710
However, we can make up for
the weakness with numbers.

17:43.200 --> 17:44.420
Princess!

18:09.960 --> 18:11.180
Princess Kaguya!

18:11.400 --> 18:14.280
You monster, let go of me!

18:25.200 --> 18:26.630
Princess Kaguya!

18:29.120 --> 18:30.710
Kill leyasu Tokugawa?

18:33.520 --> 18:35.240
What do you mean?

18:35.400 --> 18:38.040
My father is no longer himself.

18:39.960 --> 18:43.240
That was two years ago.

18:44.040 --> 18:50.950
After the defeat at Sekigahara, a samurai came
to talk to my father, who give in to despair.

18:56.880 --> 18:58.200
What?

18:59.000 --> 19:02.070
So the army of the East that should have won?

19:03.160 --> 19:07.160
And in that case, you would
have established the shogunate

19:07.170 --> 19:11.830
in this land of Edo and
ushered in an era of peace.

19:12.720 --> 19:16.760
Bullshit! The outcome of
battle hinges on luck!

19:17.400 --> 19:21.870
It was the army of the West
that won at Sekigahara!

19:22.200 --> 19:26.320
And today it is the Toyotomi
clan that rules in Osaka.

19:27.160 --> 19:30.710
Yasha, have you gone mad?

19:31.480 --> 19:35.470
It is our current world that has gone mad.

19:41.040 --> 19:42.520
Yasha?

19:42.680 --> 19:46.470
He is the handsome guy
we saw near Osaka Castle.

19:47.120 --> 19:51.270
So him and that scoundrel
leyasu are accomplices?

19:52.800 --> 19:55.000
Well, it's not hard to believe.

19:55.880 --> 20:02.470
After that, this Yasha decided to
stay close to my father permanently.

20:02.640 --> 20:03.870
Then...

20:08.800 --> 20:09.710
Little Hidetada...

20:10.640 --> 20:11.960
Little Hidetada?

20:12.320 --> 20:14.470
Finish your story later.

20:17.480 --> 20:18.830
It's close...

20:19.240 --> 20:19.960
Where is it?

20:29.280 --> 20:30.730
What is happening?

20:31.040 --> 20:33.870
The carriage is moving without horses.

20:35.240 --> 20:37.150
And it's going fast!

20:38.160 --> 20:39.670
It's simple.

20:39.840 --> 20:42.400
It's moving with ayakashi powers.

20:43.280 --> 20:46.880
Have they kidnapped someone?

20:47.720 --> 20:50.110
- Wanna help?
- Of course!

20:50.280 --> 20:53.320
Maybe there is a beautiful maiden inside!

21:05.400 --> 21:06.600
You look happy.

21:08.920 --> 21:09.880
In fact...

21:10.760 --> 21:14.040
I wish I could handle this gun perfectly.

21:15.640 --> 21:16.870
Are you sure?

21:17.400 --> 21:21.440
If you overdo with the first before finding the second, you will become a demon.

21:22.120 --> 21:25.160
I don't care.
If it happens, it happens.

21:26.040 --> 21:30.760
I don't know who you are,
damsel, but we will save you!

21:30.920 --> 21:33.990
But it would be good if you were beautiful!

21:34.840 --> 21:37.910
We don't even know if it's a woman.

21:38.720 --> 21:41.310
No, I'm certain it's a beautiful girl!

21:48.480 --> 21:49.730
I did it!

22:04.640 --> 22:06.390
Musashi again.

22:07.040 --> 22:10.560
We have no chance against him in a new moon.

22:23.200 --> 22:26.110
One would think the ayakashi would give up.

22:28.560 --> 22:29.760
Let's see...

22:29.920 --> 22:33.550
Let's take a look at our
beautiful maiden in the carriage.

22:35.560 --> 22:39.390
I can't be helped,
he wants it to be a woman.

22:51.240 --> 22:52.230
Princess Kaguya!

23:03.040 --> 23:05.030
That's Princess Kaguya?

23:06.000 --> 23:08.470
Is this the first time you've seen her?

23:11.200 --> 23:13.240
She's making a weird face.

23:20.120 --> 23:21.190
Hidetada!

23:43.440 --> 23:46.000
Princess Kaguya, I must kill you!

24:00.250 --> 24:03.000
In my natural, unadorned style,

24:03.000 --> 24:05.840
I'll tell you these feelings of mine

24:05.840 --> 24:11.180
Together to the sky past the darkness!

24:11.180 --> 24:16.310
All we need to do is spread our wings and fly!

24:17.850 --> 24:22.980
Baby, we'll send time flowing forward just a little,

24:22.980 --> 24:29.160
and we'll embrace even the harsh gusts of wind

24:29.160 --> 24:34.490
with sympathy for pointless worries

24:34.490 --> 24:38.620
and a melody that will overcome the pain

24:41.000 --> 24:51.390
If the poison of the flower that bloomed in my cupped hands

24:51.390 --> 25:02.310
has managed to pierce through the center of my heart...

25:02.310 --> 25:05.070
In my natural, unadorned style,

25:05.070 --> 25:07.940
I'll tell you these feelings of mine,

25:07.940 --> 25:13.530
Unraveling this puzzle of the heart

25:13.530 --> 25:16.290
I'll bring out every part

25:16.290 --> 25:19.290
of your unchanging style

25:19.290 --> 25:24.590
Together to the sky past the darkness!

25:24.590 --> 25:29.760
All we need to do is spread our wings and fly!

25:30.880 --> 25:33.050
So Ryogen is leyasu Tokugawa?

25:33.800 --> 25:37.100
And what is Kaguya's true identity?

25:38.140 --> 25:40.190
Is this a joke?

25:40.390 --> 25:43.200
The next chapter: <i>Sorceress of the Moon</i>!
